From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jony <raft-mobile-jony@mail.build>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 22:06:34 +0800
Subject: fix(ios): complete failed asynchronous image cache loads

Subscribe to both image outcomes and settle each load once. Remove failed entries so callers can retry, preserve newer same-key loads, and avoid retaining modules through loading views.

Fork-Patch: ios-memory-cache-completion
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: Jony <raft-mobile-jony@mail.build>

diff --git a/core-render-ios/Extension/Modules/KRMemoryCacheModule.m b/core-render-ios/Extension/Modules/KRMemoryCacheModule.m
